BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:DhQ9QCOvXsP0hgLVBpH0@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:Demystifying the OD Job Search
LOCATION:White Oak Hall Room 204\, 555 31st Street\, Downers Grove\, IL 60515\, United States
DESCRIPTION:"Demystifying the OD Job Search" event for your 1st-4th year students!  It's an open\, practical conversation about what to actually expect when searching for your first OD role: how the process works\, what to look for in an opportunity\, common pitfalls\, and the tools and feedback that can help you land an exciting position. It's tailored specifically to optometry and your career path\, not generic career advice.\n\n\nMeeting Link: https://meet.google.com/ywz-qmgj-aux?utm_source=luma\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377991
DTSTART:20261109T220000Z
DTEND:20261110T010000Z
END:VEVENT
