BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gvDzGG2NsrKvDEpCuxYw@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:Interdisciplinary Pediatric Health Club Coat and Winter Clothing Drive
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:IPHC is partnering with Cradles to Crayons to host a Coat & Winter Clothing Drive from Monday\, November 30th to Monday\, December 14th! Donation boxes will be in Redwood and The Commons.\n\nWe’re collecting new and gently used winter coats and warm clothing (sizes 0–3 months to adult medium)\, winter boots (toddler 5 to adult 10)\, and hats\, gloves\, and scarves in all sizes. We’re also happy to take shoes\, pajamas\, new socks and underwear\, new school supplies\, new hygiene items\, and unopened diapers and wipes.\n\nSince quality equals dignity\, please make sure donations have no rips\, tears\, stains\, or excessive wear\, and no holiday or family references.\n\nAll donations go to Cradles to Crayons\, which provides children in low-income or homeless situations with the essentials they need to thrive\, free of charge.\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378102
DTSTART:20261130T140000Z
DTEND:20261214T230000Z
END:VEVENT
