UID:FMEE84DmIsahCdB5vvCr@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:SAVMA Pickleball Tournament
LOCATION:Rec Center Gym AND Outdoor Basketball Courts\,
DESCRIPTION:Kick off winter quarter with a fun\, competitive 2v2 pickleball tournament! Teams of two are welcome\, and significant others can participate as long as one teammate is a current MWU student. All skill levels are welcome\, and matching outfits are encouraged! Registration is $20 per team ($10 per person)\, with some exciting prizes for the top three placing teams. Tournament will be held on campus on the basketball courts and in the rec center\, with pool play and bracket-style competition. The event will take place December 4th–6th\, with the goal of wrapping up by Saturday if possible. Enjoy concessions\, a bake sale\, and other goodies throughout the event. Come compete\, have fun\, and show off your team spirit!\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=378012
DTSTART:20261204T230000Z
DTEND:20261207T020000Z
